# Packed product certificates for the Thompson generator product

Packed witnesses certify the product of the fixed ATLAS matrices and its
powers along the addition chain 1, 2, 4, 8, 9, 18, 19. Each multiplication is
checked by kernel reduction using `BinaryMatrix.rowProduct`; its soundness
identifies these checks with multiplication of 248 by 248 matrices over GF(2).
The final algebraic assembly is in the parent `ProductOrder` module.

Source: the standard-generator relation on the ATLAS Thompson group page,
https://brauer.maths.qmul.ac.uk/Atlas/v3/spor/Th/ (R. A. Wilson,
S. J. Nickerson and J. N. Bray). Matrix provenance is in
`Model/source/README.md`. `ProductOrder/Generate.py` generates the witnesses;
its computation is not part of the proof.
-/

